</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Colorful leaves along a staircase catch the morning sunlight. 石段沿いの紅葉が、朝の日差しを浴びている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101548_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101548_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Komyoji Temple・光明寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261121/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Komyoji Temple・光明寺" /><published>2026-11-21T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-21T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/komyoji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261121/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
