</p>
<p class="jp">
東本願寺の阿弥陀堂が色鮮やかにライトアップされ、遠くに京都タワーが望める。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Night" /><category term="Lightup" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Kyoto Tower" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A colorful illumination of Amida Hall at Higashi Honganji temple, with Kyoto Tower in the distance. 東本願寺の阿弥陀堂が色鮮やかにライトアップされ、遠くに京都タワーが望める。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101263.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101263.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Rainbow Along the River・川沿いの彩り</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261117/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Rainbow Along the River・川沿いの彩り" /><published>2026-11-17T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-17T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/oigawa</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261117/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
