</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Katsura River" /><category term="Boats" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Boat riders on the Oigawa river enjoy a colorful view. 大堰川をボートで乗る人々は、色鮮やかな景色を目の前に広がっている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101157.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101157.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Okochi Sanso Garden・大河内山荘</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261116/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Okochi Sanso Garden・大河内山荘" /><published>2026-11-16T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-16T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/okochi</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261116/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
