At Jingo-ji Temple, on Mt. Takao north of Arashiyama, we found some nicely colored maple leaves. This building is the mausoleum of the 8th-century courtier <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wake_no_Kiyomaro" target="_blank">Wake no Kiyomaro</a>.
</p>
<p class="jp">
嵐山の北、高雄山の神護寺で、色づいた美しい紅葉を見つけた。この建物は、8世紀の貴族、 <a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/和気清麻呂" target="_blank">和気清麻呂</a>の霊廟だ。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[At Jingo-ji Temple, on Mt. Takao north of Arashiyama, we found some nicely colored maple leaves. This building is the mausoleum of the 8th-century courtier Wake no Kiyomaro. 嵐山の北、高雄山の神護寺で、色づいた美しい紅葉を見つけた。この建物は、8世紀の貴族、 和気清麻呂の霊廟だ。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101089.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101089.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Enryakuji Temple・延暦寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261111/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Enryakuji Temple・延暦寺" /><published>2026-11-11T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-11T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/enryakuji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261111/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
It was cold at the top of Mt. Hiei between Kyoto and Otsu, but we were rewarded with a blaze of autumn color.
</p>
<p class="jp">
京都と大津にまたがる比叡山の山頂は寒かったが、燃えるような紅葉が私たちを迎えてくれた。
</p>
