</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Gardens" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The tea house at the Okochi Sanso Villa in the late afternoon. The sudden cold weather is starting to turn the maple leaves red. 午後遅く、大河内山荘の茶屋。急な冷え込みで、もみじが赤く色づき始めている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX100956_edit-2.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX100956_edit-2.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry></feed>